          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000014\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The repair succeeds and the kite’s flight gives a clear, satisfying image, though the boat-sail remark is left unexplained.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000028\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The repair succeeds and the kite’s flight gives a clear, satisfying image, though the boat-sail remark is left unexplained.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000058\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The child turns the torn kite into a boat sail, and the boat’s journey is a concrete ending; the initial kite goal is abandoned without much reflection.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000023\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The child turns the torn kite into a boat sail, and the boat’s journey is a concrete ending; the initial kite goal is abandoned without much reflection.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000036\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"When the taped kite tears again, the child repurposes it as a sail; the failure drives a complete, concrete resolution.\",\"group_id\":2},{\"id\":\"s000017\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The repair succeeds and the kite’s flight gives a clear, satisfying image, though the boat-sail remark is left unexplained.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000053\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The child turns the torn kite into a boat sail, and the boat’s journey is a concrete ending; the initial kite goal is abandoned without much reflection.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000021\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The repaired kite tears again, prompting a useful new plan that succeeds when the boat sails across the pond.\",\"group_id\":2},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The child makes a sail from the torn kite and the boat sails, though the change from kite-flying to boat-building feels abrupt.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000048\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The child makes a sail from the torn kite and the boat sails; the thin-paper detail has little effect on the outcome.\",\"group_id\":1}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":2,\"causal_path\":3,\"ending\":3,\"language\":2,\"overall\":3},\"diversity_evidence\":\"The set shares a torn-kite problem and a sail/boat or kite-flight outcome. Stories s000014, s000028, and s000017 repair and fly the kite; s000058, s000023, s000053, s000034, and s000048 repurpose it as a boat sail; s000036 and s000021 first attempt a repair that fails, then make a sail. These are modest causal variations within a tightly repeated template, not evidence about the generator as a whole.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"Tape the torn kite and fly it successfully.\"},{\"group_id\":1,\"summary\":\"Use material from the torn kite to make a boat sail, then sail the boat.\"},{\"group_id\":2,\"summary\":\"Attempt to repair and fly the kite; it tears again, so repurpose it as a boat sail.\"}]}",
